    "eTitle": "AIDA Communication Funnel Conversion & Drop-off Engine",
    "eDesc": "Implement function `evaluateAidaFunnel(impressions, clicks, leads, purchases)` calculating stage conversion rates through Attention, Interest, Desire, and Action. Return `{ clickThroughRateAttentionToInterest: number, leadRateInterestToDesire: number, purchaseRateDesireToAction: number, overallConversionPercent: number }`.",
    "eStarter": "/**\n * Analyzes consumer drop-off across the AIDA (Attention, Interest, Desire, Action) communication funnel.\n * \n * @param {number} impressions - Ad impressions (Attention)\n * @param {number} clicks - Clicks generated (Interest)\n * @param {number} leads - Qualified leads captured (Desire)\n * @param {number} purchases - Final transactions closed (Action)\n * @returns {{\n *   clickThroughRateAttentionToInterest: number,\n *   leadRateInterestToDesire: number,\n *   purchaseRateDesireToAction: number,\n *   overallConversionPercent: number\n * }} Funnel conversion rates\n */\nfunction evaluateAidaFunnel(impressions, clicks, leads, purchases) {\n  // TODO: Compute conversion % at each step and overall funnel conversion\n  \n}",
