    "aStarter": "/**\n * Computes conversion rates, relative statistical lift, and winner determination for marketing A/B tests.\n * \n * @param {number} controlVisitors - Total visitors exposed to control version (A)\n * @param {number} controlConversions - Conversions registered in control (A)\n * @param {number} variantVisitors - Total visitors exposed to variant version (B)\n * @param {number} variantConversions - Conversions registered in variant (B)\n * @returns {{\n *   controlConversionRatePercent: number,\n *   variantConversionRatePercent: number,\n *   relativeConversionLiftPercent: number,\n *   isVariantWinning: boolean\n * }} A/B test conversion performance report\n */\nfunction calculateAbTestLift(controlVisitors, controlConversions, variantVisitors, variantConversions) {\n  // TODO: crA = (convA / visA) * 100; crB = (convB / visB) * 100; lift = ((crB - crA) / crA) * 100; return report\n  \n}",
